    <bpmn:process id="W_W382" name="W382. IT Backup &amp; Recovery Operations" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Scheduled backup window; or request for data restoration
Frequency: Daily (Incremental); Weekly (Full); Monthly (Archive)
Volume: Protecting ~50TB+ across ERP, WMS, File Servers, and Databases
Owner: IT Infrastructure Manager
Participants: Backup Admin, DBAs, Cloud Architect
Source: workflow W382 — IT Backup &amp; Recovery Operations</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W382_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W382_Lane1" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W382_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W382_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W382_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W382_Lane2" name="Backup Admin">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W382_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W382_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W382_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W382_End10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W382_Start4" name="Scheduled backup window; or request for data restoration">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W382_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W382_Task5" name="Execution">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Execution: Automated backup jobs run per schedule; cover all production databases, application configurations, and unstructured data
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Overnight</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W382_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W382_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W382_Task6" name="Monitoring">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Monitoring: Backup Admin reviews &quot;Backup Success&quot; report daily; investigates and restarts any failed jobs within 4 hours
Responsible (R): Backup Admin
Accountable (A): IT Infra Mgr
Duration: 30 min/day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W382_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W382_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W382_Task7" name="Off-site/Immutability">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Off-site/Immutability: Ensure backups are replicated to a secondary region or &quot;air-gapped&quot; vault to protect against ransomware
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): IT Infra Mgr
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W382_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W382_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W382_Task8" name="Verification">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Verification: Monthly: Perform a random &quot;Restore Test&quot; of a sample database or file set to verify data integrity and recovery time
Responsible (R): Backup Admin
Accountable (A): IT Infra Mgr
Duration: 2 hours/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W382_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W382_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W382_Task9" name="Restoration Request">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Restoration Request: Upon business request (e.g., accidental file deletion), identify correct recovery point; restore data to target location
Responsible (R): Backup Admin
Accountable (A): IT Infra Mgr
Duration: 15–60 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W382_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W382_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W382_End10" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W382_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
