    <bpmn:process id="W_W384" name="W384. ERP Environment Management &amp; Data Masking" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Scheduled test cycle (W73), new project development (W132), or request for data refresh from production
Frequency: Quarterly or as-needed per project
Volume: Managing Sandbox, Dev, QA, and Pre-prod environments
Owner: Cloud / Database Architect
Participants: DBA, DevOps Engineer, IT Security Manager, App Leads
Source: workflow W384 — ERP Environment Management &amp; Data Masking</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W384_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W384_Lane1" name="Project">
