      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: New remote user (W152); or security policy update
Frequency: Daily enrollment; Monthly access review
Volume: Supporting ~2,000+ remote/office employees
Owner: IT Infrastructure Manager
Participants: Network Engineer, Security Admin, IT Helpdesk
Source: workflow W393 — Remote Access, VPN &amp; Zero Trust Connectivity Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W393_LaneSet5">
        <bpmn:lane id="W393_Lane1" name="IT Helpdesk">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W393_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
