        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-323 (ensure controlled execution — Infrastructure &amp; Platform (PA-27.2).) | - operational: Mobility Lead review and approval gate
Owner: Mobility Lead</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
