    <bpmn:process id="W_W733" name="W733. Enterprise API Gateway Daily Monitoring &amp; Health Dashboard" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Start of IT operations day; or automated API health alert
Frequency: Daily review; continuous automated monitoring
Volume: ~50–80 active API integrations; ~2–5M API calls/day (POS events, ecommerce orders, payment confirmations, bank feeds, etc.)
Owner: IT Integration Manager
Participants: IT Operations (per W595), Ecommerce Operations Manager, Finance Systems Analyst
Source: workflow W733 — Enterprise API Gateway Daily Monitoring &amp; Health Dashboard</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W733_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W733_Lane1" name="IT Integration Mgr">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W733_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W733_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W733_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W733_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W733_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W733_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W733_Start3" name="Start of IT operations day; or automated API health alert">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W733_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W733_Task4" name="Morning API health dashboard review">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Morning API health dashboard review: IT Integration Manager reviews API health dashboard: (a) overall API availability: target 99.9% uptime; (b) per-integration health: (i) POS ↔ ERP event streaming: latency &lt;30 sec per POS-013, success rate &gt;99.99%; (ii) Ecommerce ↔ ERP: order sync, inventory sync, price sync status; (iii) Payment gateway: confirmation throughput and error rate; (iv) Bank feeds: statement import and payment file transmission; (v) BIR eFPS: filing connectivity; (vi) Delivery partners: order dispatch and status API; (vii) WMS RF guns: real-time sync status; (c) overnight batch results: any scheduled API batch jobs that failed (POS nightly reconciliation, inventory snapshot, price refresh); (d) current error queue: failed API calls awaiting retry or manual intervention
Responsible (R): IT Integration Mgr
Accountable (A): IT Manager
Duration: 15-20 min/day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W733_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W733_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W733_Task5" name="API error triage and resolution">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: API error triage and resolution: for each API error or failure: (a) classify severity: (i) P1 Critical: POS event streaming down, payment gateway down — revenue impact; (ii) P2 Major: ecommerce order sync delayed, bank feed failure — operational impact; (iii) P3 Minor: reporting API slow, non-critical integration intermittent — minimal impact; (b) P1 resolution: (i) immediately escalate to IT Operations per W380 alert management; (ii) engage external vendor if third-party API issue per W369; (iii) activate fallback procedures (e.g., offline POS per W535 if POS API is down); (iv) target resolution: &lt;1 hour; (c) P2 resolution: (i) investigate root cause; (ii) retry failed transactions; (iii) target resolution: &lt;4 hours; (d) P3 resolution: batch for weekly review and backlog prioritization per W616
Responsible (R): IT Integration Mgr
Accountable (A): IT Manager
Duration: 15-30 min/day + variable for incidents</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W733_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W733_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W733_Task6" name="API performance trend analysis">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: API performance trend analysis: weekly, IT Integration Manager analyzes API performance trends: (a) response time trends by integration: are any APIs getting slower?; (b) error rate trends: recurring errors that need root cause fix vs. transient errors; (c) throughput trends: is API volume growing as expected with business growth?; (d) capacity planning: current API call volume vs. rate limit thresholds per W376; (e) identify APIs needing optimization or version upgrade per W257 lifecycle
Responsible (R): IT Integration Mgr
Accountable (A): IT Manager
Duration: 1-2 hours/week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W733_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W733_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W733_Task7" name="API security monitoring">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: API security monitoring: continuous monitoring for API security issues: (a) authentication failures: spike in 401 errors may indicate credential compromise or system misconfiguration; (b) rate limit violations: unexpected API call spikes may indicate abuse or system malfunction; (c) certificate expiry monitoring: SSL/TLS certificates per W377 for API endpoints approaching expiry (alert at 30, 14, 7 days); (d) API key rotation: monitor for keys approaching rotation schedule
Responsible (R): IT Integration Mgr / IT Security
Accountable (A): IT Manager
Duration: 10-15 min/day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W733_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W733_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W733_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W733_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W733_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-323 (ensure controlled execution — Infrastructure &amp; Platform (PA-27.2).) | - operational: IT Integration Manager review and approval gate; operational: periodic reconciliation against source documents
Owner: IT Integration Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
