    <bpmn:process id="W_W832" name="W832. ERP User Access Quarterly Recertification &amp; Compliance Review" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Quarterly calendar trigger (March, June, September, December)
Frequency: Quarterly
Volume: ~6,762 employees across 5 entities with ERP access; ~200–300 role changes per quarter to recertify
Owner: IT Security Manager
Participants: IT Security Manager, Department Managers, HR BP, Internal Audit per W338
Source: workflow W832 — ERP User Access Quarterly Recertification &amp; Compliance Review</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W832_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W832_Lane1" name="IT Security Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W832_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W832_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W832_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W832_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W832_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W832_Task13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W832_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W832_Lane2" name="Department Managers">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W832_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W832_Lane3" name="Internal Audit">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W832_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W832_End14</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W832_Start5" name="Quarterly calendar trigger (March, June, September, December)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W832_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W832_Task6" name="Recertification campaign initiation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Recertification campaign initiation: IT Security Manager initiates quarterly campaign: (a) system generates access certification report — all users, their roles, and access levels across all ERP modules; (b) filters for high-risk access: finance (AP/AR/GL posting), payroll, master data creation, pricing changes, inventory adjustments, user administration; (c) identifies access changes since last recertification
Responsible (R): IT Security Manager
Accountable (A): CIO
Duration: 4 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W832_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W832_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W832_Task7" name="Manager recertification">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Manager recertification: system sends access list to each Department Manager: (a) list of all employees in their department with current ERP access; (b) manager reviews each employee: &quot;Confirm&quot; (access appropriate), &quot;Modify&quot; (change needed), &quot;Revoke&quot; (employee should not have this access); (c) SLA: 10 business days for manager review
Responsible (R): Department Managers
Accountable (A): IT Security Manager
Duration: 2 hours/manager</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W832_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W832_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W832_Task8" name="SOD violation review">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: SOD violation review: IT Security Manager reviews SOD conflicts flagged by system: (a) AP clerk with vendor master creation access; (b) inventory adjustment with GL posting access; (c) payroll processing with employee master changes; (d) pricing changes with markdown approval
Responsible (R): IT Security Manager
Accountable (A): Internal Audit
Duration: 8-12 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W832_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W832_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W832_Task9" name="Remediation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Remediation: (a) confirmed revocations executed via W152 provisioning; (b) SOD conflicts resolved through role redesign or compensating controls per W338; (c) orphaned accounts (employees who transferred per W511 or separated per W43 with active access) immediately revoked
Responsible (R): IT Security Manager / HR BP
Accountable (A): CIO
Duration: 4-8 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W832_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W832_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W832_Task10" name="Cross-entity review">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Cross-entity review: for employees with cross-entity access per W511 transfers: (a) verify access is limited to current entity; (b) revoke old entity access if transfer completed
Responsible (R): IT Security Manager / HR BP
Accountable (A): CIO
Duration: 2-4 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W832_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W832_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W832_Task11" name="Internal Audit verification">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Internal Audit verification: W338 SOD audit team samples 10% of recertification results for verification
Responsible (R): Internal Audit
Accountable (A): Head of Internal Audit
Duration: 4-6 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W832_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W832_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W832_Task12" name="Recertification close-out">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: Recertification close-out: (a) IT Security Manager documents completion; (b) unresolved items escalated to CIO; (c) certification report filed for W120 audit evidence; (d) access metrics dashboard updated
Responsible (R): IT Security Manager
Accountable (A): CIO
Duration: 2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W832_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W832_Flow24</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W832_Task13" name="Quarterly metrics reporting">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 8: Quarterly metrics reporting: (a) recertification completion rate (target: 100%); (b) average days to complete; (c) revocations executed; (d) SOD violations identified and remediated; (e) orphaned accounts found; (f) trend vs. prior quarters
Responsible (R): IT Security Manager
Accountable (A): CIO / Internal Audit
Duration: 2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W832_Flow24</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W832_Flow25</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W832_End14" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W832_Flow25</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W832_Annotation15">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-323 (ensure controlled execution — Infrastructure &amp; Platform (PA-27.2).) | - operational: IT Security Manager review and approval gate
Owner: IT Security Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
