    <bpmn:process id="W_W5518" name="W5518. Collaboration &amp; Productivity Platform (M365/Email/Teams) Operations &amp; Tenant Governance" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Tenant incident or service-health degradation (mail-flow delay, Teams outage); new-hire mailbox &amp; collaboration provisioning from W152; quarterly security-baseline review; or the monthly tenant-service review cadence
Frequency: Continuous monitoring; per-provisioning event; monthly service review; quarterly baseline review
Volume: ~6,762 M365 users; ~1,500 ERP identities federated (W152); ~50+ SaaS apps in the tenant portfolio (W370); ~40 provisioning/lifecycle exceptions/month
Owner: IT Infrastructure Manager
Participants: IT Infrastructure Lead, Security Analyst, IT Helpdesk, Service Desk Lead, Application Manager (ERP SSO federation), Data Protection Officer, Internal Audit
Source: workflow W5518 — Collaboration &amp; Productivity Platform (M365/Email/Teams) Operations &amp; Tenant Governance</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5518_LaneSet6">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5518_Lane1" name="System">
