    <bpmn:process id="W_W5519" name="W5519. Enterprise Messaging &amp; Store Telephony Services (UCC) Lifecycle" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Store or HQ telephony fault (W48 ticket); new-store telephony build (VS-37); extension moves/adds/changes request; or carrier trunk degradation alarm
Frequency: Continuous trunk monitoring; ~40 MACs/month; quarterly failover test; annual extension &amp; billing audit
Volume: 200 stores + 4 DCs + HQ; ~600–800 store extensions (3–4/store); ~500 HQ/DC UCC users; ~10–15 carrier circuits
Owner: IT Infrastructure Manager
Participants: Network Engineers, IT Helpdesk, Store Managers, Regional Managers, Customer Experience Manager (CS queue per PA-13.1), carrier account managers
Source: workflow W5519 — Enterprise Messaging &amp; Store Telephony Services (UCC) Lifecycle</bpmn:documentation>
